sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as Terminal/Desktop
  participant Profile as Profile service
  participant Keychain as OS keychain
  participant Registry as Provider registry
  participant Adapter as Provider adapter
  participant API as Model API

  User->>UI: Add provider + secret
  UI->>Profile: validate provider id and key format
  Profile->>Keychain: write(profile/provider, secret)
  Keychain-->>Profile: opaque credential reference
  Profile-->>UI: saved(profile id, provider id, status)
  UI->>Registry: start run(profile, provider, model)
  Registry->>Keychain: resolve credential reference
  Keychain-->>Registry: in-memory secret
  Registry->>Adapter: normalized request + secret
  Adapter->>API: provider-specific HTTPS call
  API-->>Adapter: response / rate-limit metadata
  Adapter-->>Registry: normalized proposal or classified error
  Registry-->>UI: versioned events; never secret
